#: index.docbook:704
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&kappname; comes with a skin editor, named ksirkskineditor(!), that allows to edit all skin data, as soon as graphics (map, sprites, etc.) are available in a SVG file. Please see the ksirkskineditor manual for further details."
msgid "&ksirk; comes with a skin editor, named ksirkskineditor(!), that allows to edit all skin data, as soon as graphics (map, sprites, &etc;) are available in a SVG file. Please see the ksirkskineditor manual for further details."
msgstr "O &kappname; vén cun editor de temas visuais, chamado ksirkskineditor(!), que permite editar todos os datos dos temas visuais, ao tempo que os gráficos (mapas, sprites, etc.) están dispoñíbeis nun ficheiro en SVG. Consulta o manual do ksirkskineditor para máis detalles."

